eds to be addressed. It is important to create an inclusive environment where individuals are treated fairly and have equal opportunities for growth and advancement. Discrimination based on race or gender not only hampers the progress of individuals but also hinders the overall development of society. Companies must strive to implement policies and practices that promote diversity and eradicate biases. This includes providing equal pay, ensuring equal representation in leadership positions, and fostering a culture of inclusivity. By fostering equality, workplaces become more productive and employees feel valued and respected.", "encoded_message": "Cultural as well as gender fairness inside the work environment is a critical topic that requires to be tackled. It constitutes crucial to develop an comprehensive atmosphere where persons are dealt with justly and have same prospects for development and improvement. Partiality founded on ethnicity or gender not only thwarts the development of persons but also prevents the general evolution of the public. Enterprises have to make efforts to enact protocols and procedures that foster heterogeneity and extinguish inclinations. This involves supplying equal pay, ensuring equal representation in leadership positions, and fostering a culture of inclusivity. By fostering equality, workplaces become more productive and employees feel valued and respected.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 3.36, "secret_key_generation": 100.72}, "decoding_time": 0.0003540515899658203, "decoded_message": "1110101000100011011010011000101110001011001011011100110110011010", "error_message": ""}